# ------------------------------------------------------------
# 10. Keep Important Project Files
# ------------------------------------------------------------

# README.md should be committed
# pom.xml should be committed
# package.json and lockfiles should be committed
# Maven wrapper scripts should be committed if present
# screenshots/ should be committed
# database/helpdesk_schema.sql should be committed
# frontend/src/ should be committed
# backend/src/ should be committed
